OL,3,ANottingham attacks family condemn
OL,4,Apolice promotion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a student who was stabbed
OL,7,Fto death in the Nottingham attacks has
OL,8,Fcriticised a move by Nottinghamshire
OL,9,FPolice to promote the senior officer
OL,10,Fwho led the investigation.
OL,12,FGrace O'Malley-Kumar, Barnaby Webber
OL,13,Fand Ian Coates were stabbed on 13 June
OL,14,F2023 by Valdo Calocane, leading to a
OL,15,Fpublic inquiry.
OL,17,FRob Griffin, of Nottinghamshire Police,
OL,18,Fwas temporary deputy chief constable
OL,19,Ffrom 29 April 2025 and was appointed
OL,20,Fsubstantively into the role following a
OL,21,Fselection process in August, the force
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
